# Event Anatomy

The 4728 event provides multiple important identities.

Conceptually:

```text
SUBJECT
Account performing change
        |
        v
GROUP
Domain Admins
        |
        v
MEMBER
Account receiving membership
```

For the Sprint 23 simulation:

```text
Authorized Administrator
        |
        | adds
        v
det005test
        |
        | to
        v
Domain Admins
```

This distinction is important during analyst triage.

The actor and the account receiving privilege are not necessarily the same account.

