# DET-005 Development

Created:

```text
DET-005 — Privileged Domain Group Membership Change
```

Objective:

> Detect additions to high-privilege Active Directory security groups that require immediate security review.

Initial detection:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728 "Domain Admins"
```

Expanded detection:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
("Domain Admins" OR "Enterprise Admins" OR "Schema Admins")
```

Portfolio output:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
("Domain Admins" OR "Enterprise Admins" OR "Schema Admins")
| eval detection="DET-005 - Privileged Domain Group Membership Change"
| table _time detection host _raw
```

Additional fields can be added after confirming the exact field names exposed by the lab's Splunk environment.

